56:36-08:00","id":1041112,"title":"","content":"I am still buzzed that Synergy is going to be more individualistic, based on the actual relationship between the Geist and their Bound, possibly having clauses from the Bargain.<br /> <br /> You know, the idea of losing Synergy because you aren't holding your end of the deal sounds awesome.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Thoughts ripple out, birthing others","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1624-falleneco","name":"FallenEco","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1624_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1927"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-01-31T03:53:14-08:00","id":1041182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>FallenEco</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/geist-the-sin-eaters/941893-geist-2nd-edition-thoughts-speculations?p=1041112#post1041112\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I am still buzzed that Synergy is going to be more individualistic, based on the actual relationship between the Geist and their Bound, possibly having clauses from the Bargain.<br /> <br /> You know, the idea of losing Synergy because you aren't holding your end of the deal sounds awesome.</div> </div> </div> </div>\u200bI can wholeheartedly agree with that. The idea of a 'contract' between Geist and Bound is a really interesting one.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img 